│     raise error_class(parsed_response, operation_name)                                                                                          │
│ botocore.errorfactory.ValidationException: An error occurred (ValidationException) when calling the ConverseStream operation: The model         │
│ returned the following errors: Input is too long for requested model.                                                                           │
│ ```                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                 │
